  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents 1.0.0-beta.1\n\n      Added\n      - Explicit previous event-name mappings for durable namespace and type renames.\n      - Cleanup storage contract used by the hosted cleanup service.\n      - TEV002 compile-time diagnostic for unsupported generic event contracts.\n\n      Hardened\n      - Durable event identity, generated dispatch, retry, lease, and failure behavior.\n      - Package API, manifest, isolated restore, and runtime compatibility gates.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Evidence-backed pre-1.0 beta with documented at-least-once boundaries.\n      - Upgrade every TinyEvents package in the application to beta.1 together.",
